# UI Tokens

## Themes
Two themes: dark (default) and light. Toggle persisted in `localStorage`, applied as `data-theme="dark|light"` on `<html>`. CSS variables in `app/globals.css`, extended in `tailwind.config.ts`.

## Color tokens (CSS variables)
Define in `@layer base { :root { ... } [data-theme="light"] { ... } }`.

### Semantic (same in both themes)
```css
--accent:      #9DD0B0;
--accent-bg:   rgba(157, 208, 176, 0.10);
--pass:        #7FB394;   /* dark */  #5A8F70;  /* light */
--warn:        #D9B566;   /* dark */  #B89540;  /* light */
--fail:        #E07B6E;   /* dark */  #C25D52;  /* light */
--fail-bg:     rgba(224, 123, 110, 0.07);
```

### Neutrals (vary by theme)
```css
/* dark theme (default) */
--bg-0: #0D0D0D;    /* page background */
--bg-1: #141414;    /* card / panel */
--bg-2: #1A1A1A;    /* hover row */
--bg-3: #202020;    /* selected / active */
--line:   #262626;  /* primary border */
--line-2: #1E1E1E;  /* subtle divider */
--line-3: #2E2E2E;  /* strong border */
--fg-0: #F0F0F0;    /* primary text */
--fg-1: #A0A0A0;    /* secondary text */
--fg-2: #606060;    /* muted / placeholder */
--fg-3: #383838;    /* disabled */

/* light theme */
--bg-0: #FAFAFA;
--bg-1: #FFFFFF;
--bg-2: #F5F5F5;
--bg-3: #EEEEEE;
--line:   #E4E4E7;
--line-2: #F0F0F0;
--line-3: #D4D4D8;
--fg-0: #09090B;
--fg-1: #52525B;
--fg-2: #A1A1AA;
--fg-3: #D4D4D8;
```

