## Spacing
Tailwind default 4px grid. No custom spacing values.

## Borders
Always `1px solid var(--line)`. No thicker borders anywhere.

## Shadows
Only status-dot halo:
```css
box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(157, 208, 176, 0.20);  /* accent halo */
box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(127, 179, 148, 0.20);  /* pass halo */
box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(224, 123, 110, 0.20);  /* fail halo */
```
No drop shadows. No `shadow-*` Tailwind classes.

## Border radius
Zero everywhere. `rounded-none` on all shadcn overrides.
